{"4750870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Don’t Pop!: Splash Race", "steam_appid": 4750870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4750970], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Title:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't Pop!: Splash Race</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Genre:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Platformer, Physics-Based Racing, Casual, Multiplayer, PvP, Party Game, Level Editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Players:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 player solo / 2-8 players online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How it plays:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't Pop!: Splash Race is a 3D physics-based racing game where you control a bouncy water balloon, make your way through obstacle courses, and try to reach the finish line first.<br>Practice a course on your own and go for a clean run, or jump into online multiplayer for a chaotic race against other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Winning:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is a single, decisive run. The first player to cross the finish line is shown as the Winner, and the results screen puts the top three on a podium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tokens and customization:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finishing a race earns you tokens, which you can spend on decorating your water balloon. Solo runs award tokens too, but multiplayer pays out more — so there's always a reason to race against others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Custom maps (Beta):</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own courses with the in-game map editor. Place objects, edit their detailed properties, and jump into a test run at any time while building. Upload your finished maps to share them, download maps made by other players, and play custom maps in both solo and multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crossplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam and STOVE players can race together in the same lobby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bouncy, physics-based controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A water balloon that pops the instant it hits the wrong obstacle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, fast, single-run races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo play and 2-8 player online multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable, B-movie-flavored party racing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn tokens by finishing races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your balloon with the tokens you earn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Podium finish for the top three, with a Winner callout</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own courses with the in-game map editor (Beta)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload, download, and rate community maps (Beta)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam ↔ STOVE crossplay</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Title:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't Pop!: Splash Race</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Genre:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Platformer, Physics-Based Racing, Casual, Multiplayer, PvP, Party Game, Level Editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Players:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 player solo / 2-8 players online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How it plays:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't Pop!: Splash Race is a 3D physics-based racing game where you control a bouncy water balloon, make your way through obstacle courses, and try to reach the finish line first.<br>Practice a course on your own and go for a clean run, or jump into online multiplayer for a chaotic race against other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Winning:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is a single, decisive run. The first player to cross the finish line is shown as the Winner, and the results screen puts the top three on a podium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tokens and customization:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finishing a race earns you tokens, which you can spend on decorating your water balloon. Solo runs award tokens too, but multiplayer pays out more — so there's always a reason to race against others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Custom maps (Beta):</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own courses with the in-game map editor. Place objects, edit their detailed properties, and jump into a test run at any time while building. Upload your finished maps to share them, download maps made by other players, and play custom maps in both solo and multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crossplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam and STOVE players can race together in the same lobby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bouncy, physics-based controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A water balloon that pops the instant it hits the wrong obstacle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, fast, single-run races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo play and 2-8 player online multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable, B-movie-flavored party racing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn tokens by finishing races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your balloon with the tokens you earn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Podium finish for the top three, with a Winner callout</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own courses with the in-game map editor (Beta)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload, download, and rate community maps (Beta)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam ↔ STOVE crossplay</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A physics-based online party racing game where you control a fragile water balloon, bounce through ridiculous obstacles, and race to the goal before you pop.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750870/4916c7e41c6515d3e41b42c8d713d11dc336a6ab/header.jpg?t=1785898421", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750870/0ebe00acd152ff9a14df5157bbb0de33c3425b7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785898421", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750870/0ebe00acd152ff9a14df5157bbb0de33c3425b7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785898421", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-8350 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon R7 260X or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti / AMD 